      "title": "Regional Cuisines of Iran: Gilan, Kermanshah and Local Variations | Iran, Unfolded",
      "description": "Explore documented regional food traditions, from Gilan's sour flavors to Kermanshah's culinary repertoire and locally named soups and meatballs."
